enshot-2560x1440-B.png", "id": "518199367649623", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035315_518199370982956_3030587656090885372_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=j75ldcalmRIQ7kNvwG44igk&_nc_oc=AdmgdZikupCtFcnrDNYc4S-a1_PJ4yv8euPGons0s6bC2z8EeylE_0W5lq_FTzCvIaw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzwQurh79ca7Zq3LcEoevch1h43fpZ5XLhJ2cFfOy9ReQ&oe=69BBFA8D"}, {"file_name": "SA-LS-Launch-Meta-Screenshot-2560x1440-C.png", "id": "905966224922640", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974900_905966228255973_5130841505886610815_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hSsncwBGvPsQ7kNvwHterW3&_nc_oc=AdkzWmYJ9mrvH53ga8qoT-Av5Oxod2y1T25-Y9wQ8vuJ9iVVWX41tAlMEcfN2NXHDz4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyR_gu7KUOXbJmBvNknXqnJ2dtN5vyTmzyXci0bhjyqGA&oe=69BC014B"}, {"file_name": "SA-LS-Launch-Meta-Screenshot-2560x1440-G.png", "id": "523141100328151", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031339_523141106994817_8586809118821300384_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dbUslAZJ3KsQ7kNvwG3NlUb&_nc_oc=Adnj3lGBQFN9tZvI5ebEyYcnD8l2EniUpjAuseABJQmUH2Av4u5NimKjnQJJV6ZIkjo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx_itnHYny_Z3pRDYTTtbePijgJ4vyK-T9sCmqbJt-RbQ&oe=69BBE1F5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "SA-LS-Meta-VideoCover-2560x1440.png", "id": "8770630689667401", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982555_8770630713000732_6259191283680804636_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_aid=0&_nc_ohc=mD9pt6HDwdcQ7kNvwFln0sq&_nc_oc=AdkBQhvcwJa9lXw0dZ8uPMT2JHj6NcI4DV9hfVw69jA_2EMVgTJd6tV4kUk4UDnJ_x0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyJURtqCNVQTJ5e4GVJdJSxgan4pI9k-BmG7DnvRTajdw&oe=69BBF3A8"}, "display_name": "Last Stand", "keywords": ["pvp", "shoot", "horror", "action", "duel"], "long_description": "Step into the future of mixed reality with Last Stand, from the makers of Drop Dead: The Cabin. This is the world\u2019s first multi-location mixed reality PvP shootout. Your living room becomes a battlefield as you eliminate your opponent while fending off a relentless zombie invasion. Move, dodge, and take cover in a fully immersive combat zone.\n\n{1067517198339345}\n\n**1v1 Mixed Reality PvP Combat**\n\nBattle opponents from anywhere\u2014each player fights from their own home. Turn your living room into a battlefield, outsmarting rivals with real-world strategy.\n\n{1232934048025689}\n\n**Precision Full-Body Tracking**\n\nDodge bullets like in The Matrix or land headshots like John Wick! Our full-body tracking ensures every movement feels accurate and responsive, immersing you deeply in the action.\n\n{428700763582659}\n\n**Your Room, Your Advantage**\n\nTransform your living room from a Netflix haven into a tactical stronghold. Your couch becomes a fortress; your table, a shield. Outsmart and outmaneuver\u2014your home is part of the fight!\n\n{1127967098666563}\n\n**Cinematic Shootouts at Home**\n\nExperience intense gunfights and explosive combat, with dynamic destruction shaping every encounter. With dynamic destruction, every round is as intense as a blockbuster.\n\n**Last Stand is an early access title pushing the boundaries of mixed reality. Join our community on Discord to share feedback and help us shape the future of the game.**\n\nVisit **LastStandXR.com** to learn more and join the discord.", "short_description": "Step into the future of mixed reality with Last Stand, from the makers of Drop Dead: The Cabin. This is the world\u2019s first multi-location mixed reality PvP shootout. Your living room becomes a battlefield as you eliminate your opponent while fending off a relentless zombie invasion. Move, dodge, and take cover in a fully interactive, immersive combat zone."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://soulassembly.com/privacy-policy"